      "text": "GDN: contiguous request segments\n\n1. Exchange causal-convolution halo\n2. Build local affine state summary\n3. Ordered prefix scan supplies initial state\n4. Compute local outputs + checkpoints",
      "fontSize": 27,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
