      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Full attention: local Q + sharded KV\n\n1. Round-robin Q (zigzag optional)\n2. Write K/V to absolute-position owners\n3. Visit KV owners with a double-buffered ring\n4. Merge partial outputs using LSE",
      "fontSize": 27,
